1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:09,340
On Slide 29, we examine the cutting edge of autonomous commerce: AP2, the Agent Payments Protocol.

2
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:17,000
AP2 is the open standard that allows AI agents to buy goods and subscribe to services safely on our behalf.

3
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:32,360
Pillar 1 is the Scoped Mandate. Instead of handing over a credit card number, the user issues a cryptographically signed token that says: "You may spend up to $25 exclusively at merchant X for item Y."

4
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:40,670
Pillar 2 uses Zero-Knowledge Proofs. The merchant never sees your personal banking info, preventing data leaks.

5
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:50,470
And Pillar 3 is Reversible Escrow. The funds are held in escrow until the software delivers valid proof of completion.

6
00:00:51,170 --> 00:00:54,650
This is the future of the autonomous agent economy.

